#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.title"
msgid "{{cameraName}} Streaming Settings"
msgstr "{{cameraName}} Streaming அமைப்புகள்"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.desc"
msgid ""
"Change the live streaming options for this camera group's dashboard. "
"<em>These settings are device/browser-specific.</em>"
msgstr ""
"Change the live streaming விருப்பங்கள் க்கு this camera group's dashboard. "
"<em>These அமைப்புகள் அரே device/browser-specific.</em>"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.audioIsAvailable"
msgid "Audio is available for this stream"
msgstr "Audio is available க்கு this stream"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.audioIsUnavailable"
msgid "Audio is unavailable for this stream"
msgstr "Audio is unavailable க்கு this stream"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.audio.tips.title"
msgid ""
"Audio must be output from your camera and configured in go2rtc for this "
"stream."
msgstr ""
"Audio must be output இருந்து your camera and configured in go2rtc க்கு this "
"stream."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.stream"
msgid "Stream"
msgstr "Stream"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.placeholder"
msgid "Choose a stream"
msgstr "Choose a stream"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.streamMethod.label"
msgid "Streaming Method"
msgstr "Streaming Method"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.streamMethod.placeholder"
msgid "Choose a streaming method"
msgstr "Choose a streaming method"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.streamMethod.method.noStreaming.label"
msgid "No Streaming"
msgstr "இல்லை Streaming"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.streamMethod.method.noStreaming.desc"
msgid ""
"Camera images will only update once per minute and no live streaming will "
"occur."
msgstr ""
"Camera படங்கள் will only புதுப்பிப்பு once per minute and இல்லை live "
"streaming will occur."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.streamMethod.method.smartStreaming.label"
msgid "Smart Streaming (recommended)"
msgstr "அறிவாளி Streaming (recommended)"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.streamMethod.method.smartStreaming.desc"
msgid ""
"Smart streaming will update your camera image once per minute when no "
"detectable activity is occurring to conserve bandwidth and resources. When "
"activity is detected, the image seamlessly switches to a live stream."
msgstr ""
"அறிவாளி streaming will புதுப்பிப்பு your camera படம் once per minute when "
"இல்லை detectable செய்கைப்பாடு is occurring பெறுநர் conserve பட்டை அகலம் and "
"resources. When செய்கைப்பாடு is detected, the படம் seamlessly switches "
"பெறுநர் a live stream."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.streamMethod.method.continuousStreaming.label"
msgid "Continuous Streaming"
msgstr "தொடர்ச்சியான Streaming"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt ""
"group.camera.setting.streamMethod.method.continuousStreaming.desc.title"
msgid ""
"Camera image will always be a live stream when visible on the dashboard, "
"even if no activity is being detected."
msgstr ""
"Camera படம் will எப்போதும் be a live stream when visible on the dashboard, "
"இரட்டை if இல்லை செய்கைப்பாடு is being detected."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt ""
"group.camera.setting.streamMethod.method.continuousStreaming.desc.warning"
msgid ""
"Continuous streaming may cause high bandwidth usage and performance issues. "
"Use with caution."
msgstr ""
"தொடர்ச்சியான streaming சி-வைகாசி cause high பட்டை அகலம் usage and "
"performance issues. Use with caution."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.compatibilityMode.label"
msgid "Compatibility mode"
msgstr "Compatibility பயன்முறை"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "group.camera.setting.compatibilityMode.desc"
msgid ""
"Enable this option only if your camera's live stream is displaying color "
"artifacts and has a diagonal line on the right side of the image."
msgstr ""
"Enable this சூதம் only if your camera's live stream is displaying color "
"artifacts and has a மூலைவிட்டம் வரி on the வலது பக்கம் of the image."

